This Privacy Policy is issued by Alpha Industries Private Limited ('the Company', 'we', 'us') and applies to personal data collected through https://alpha.example and related services. It describes how we collect, use, store, and protect personal data — including Name, email address, telephone number, delivery address, order history and payment reference numbers of end customers. — for the purpose of Fulfilling customer orders, issuing invoices, arranging delivery and handling returns. , in accordance with the Digital Personal Data Protection Act, 2023 and the Information Technology Act, 2000 and rules made thereunder. This Policy is effective from 2026-09-01 and applies to all users and data principals whose personal data we process.

The Parties represent and warrant that:
(a) The object and consideration of this Agreement are lawful under Section 23 of the Indian Contract Act, 1872;
(b) This Agreement is entered into with free consent under Sections 13–19 of the Indian Contract Act, 1872;
(c) Each Party is competent to contract under applicable law.

